WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:02.600
Claude Soma gives Claude Code a body.

2
00:05.000 --> 00:14.500
Hermes-Agent is 27,000 lines of platform. The question Claude Soma asks: what if the engine is Claude Code? The answer is a few thousand lines.

3
00:15.200 --> 00:25.400
You message one Telegram bot, and it acts as an orchestrator. Quick answers come straight back; slow work is dispatched to background agents, so your chat never blocks.

4
00:26.100 --> 00:35.400
Ask for a project, and it spawns a persistent project-lead: isolated in its own cgroup, running its own agent team, attachable from your phone over Remote Control.

5
00:36.100 --> 00:46.000
Voice in and out through whisper and piper. Social posts to X, LinkedIn and Medium. Scheduled routines that fire while you sleep. All on one live dashboard.

6
00:46.800 --> 00:53.800
No API keys. One Claude Max subscription. One small VPS. That is Claude Soma.
